{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040660/extras/776b5b65e1dd66d9a29abe11879d254c.poster.avif?t=1758251088\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040660/extras/776b5b65e1dd66d9a29abe11879d254c.webm?t=1758251088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040660/extras/776b5b65e1dd66d9a29abe11879d254c.mp4?t=1758251088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been transported to the uncharted Eventide Continuum. Your mission: field-test advanced mining and forging systems in this hostile environment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine Asteroids:</strong> Use your multi-laser module to harvest metal from asteroid fields.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Components:</strong> Process raw ore into construction components aboard your ship.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the Mystery Structure:</strong> Dock to your forge and assemble a massive structure, one block at a time. What could it be?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and Defend:</strong> Survive relentless enemies that pursue you and seek to destroy your progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features: One resource type, a structure to build in the forge, and a suite of ship modules including thrusters, tractor beams, and plasma cannons.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040660?t=1758251088","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040660?t=17582